<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pharmacyclics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pharmacyclics started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Vector Securities analyst Peter Drake said he started coverage of Pharmacyclics Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the development-stage cancer drug concern were up 3/8 to 16-7/8.</p>
<p>-- The company &quot;is leveraging its unique technology platform to focus on novel cancer products and MRI (magnetic resonance imaging) agents,&quot; Drake said. &quot;Its cancer focus should benefit from FDA reforms designed to speed new product introductions.&quot; -- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
